{"repo": {"timestamp": 1792913634000, "version": 20002, "name": "YuneBridge", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quompacc/yunebridge/fdroid/repo", "description": "Official repository of YuneBridge, a Gadgetbridge fork with a redesigned interface. Source code: https://github.com/quompacc/yunebridge"}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"authorName": "quompacc", "categories": ["Connectivity", "Sports & Health"], "changelog": "https://github.com/quompacc/yunebridge/releases", "suggestedVersionCode": "25506", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/quompacc/yunebridge/issues", "license": "AGPL-3.0-or-later", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/quompacc/yunebridge", "added": 1792913623000, "packageName": "io.github.quompacc.yunebridge", "lastUpdated": 1792913623000, "localized": {"de-DE": {"description": "YuneBridge ist ein Fork von <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge\">Gadgetbridge</a> mit neu gestalteter, moderner Oberfl\u00e4che. Die App spricht direkt mit deiner Smartwatch, deinem Fitnessarmband oder deinen Kopfh\u00f6rern \u2013 ohne Hersteller-App, ohne Cloud und ohne Konto.\n\nAlle Funktionen von Gadgetbridge bleiben erhalten, unter anderem:\n<ul>\n<li>Aktivit\u00e4t, Schlaf, Herzfrequenz und weitere Gesundheitsdaten, gespeichert nur auf deinem Telefon</li>\n<li>Benachrichtigungen, Anrufe und Musiksteuerung auf der Uhr</li>\n<li>Installieren von Zifferbl\u00e4ttern, Apps und Firmware-Dateien</li>\n<li>Wecker, Wetter und viele ger\u00e4tespezifische Einstellungen</li>\n<li>Datenexport und Sicherung</li>\n</ul>\n\nYuneBridge l\u00e4sst sich neben Gadgetbridge installieren. Ger\u00e4teunterst\u00fctzung, Protokolle und Hintergrunddienste stammen unver\u00e4ndert aus Gadgetbridge; YuneBridge \u00e4ndert nur das Aussehen.\n\nYuneBridge ist freie Software unter der GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 oder sp\u00e4ter. Der Dank f\u00fcr die Ger\u00e4teunterst\u00fctzung geb\u00fchrt den Entwicklerinnen und Entwicklern von Gadgetbridge.\n", "name": "YuneBridge", "summary": "Gadgetbridge-Fork mit neuem Design \u2013 ohne Cloud und Hersteller-Konto", "whatsNew": "Fehlerbehebung:\n\u2022 \u00dcbersicht: Nach dem Herunterscrollen l\u00e4sst sich wieder nach oben scrollen, statt dass jedes Mal die Aktualisierung startet\n"}, "en-US": {"description": "YuneBridge is a fork of <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge\">Gadgetbridge</a> with a redesigned, modern interface. It talks to your smartwatch, fitness band or earbuds directly \u2013 without the vendor's app, without a cloud and without an account.\n\nAll functions of Gadgetbridge are kept, including:\n<ul>\n<li>Activity, sleep, heart rate and other health data, stored only on your phone</li>\n<li>Notifications, calls and music control on the watch</li>\n<li>Installing watch faces, apps and firmware files</li>\n<li>Alarms, weather and many device-specific settings</li>\n<li>Data export and backup</li>\n</ul>\n\nYuneBridge can be installed next to Gadgetbridge. Device support, protocols and background services come unchanged from Gadgetbridge; YuneBridge only changes the look.\n\nYuneBridge is free software under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later. All credit for device support goes to the Gadgetbridge developers and contributors.\n", "icon": "icon_M94BhkZ4KIgHusYJyxhSOGO79Vzf9b8hBygkEoWScM0=.png", "name": "YuneBridge", "summary": "Gadgetbridge fork with a redesigned interface \u2013 no cloud, no vendor account", "whatsNew": "Bug fix:\n\u2022 Dashboard: after scrolling down you can scroll back up again instead of always triggering a refresh\n"}}}], "packages": {"io.github.quompacc.yunebridge": [{"added": 1792913623000, "apkName": "YuneBridge-0.95.1-yb6.apk", "features": ["android.hardware.bluetooth"], "hash": "c0d38f39c04cd5c672c19415475aed36cb314b03dc4d315a979ea1c2a66e32ac", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 23, "nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "p